title KubeQuest - session lifecycle
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Starting : authenticated start\nvalid mission / no maintenance
Starting --> Ready : guest and mission setup succeed
Starting --> Error : setup fails
Ready --> Ready : terminal, apply, grade or keepalive\nrefreshes 30-minute expiry
Ready --> Submitted : timed attempt is graded
Ready --> Stopping : stop / idle expiry / reset
Submitted --> Stopping : stop / expiry / reset
Error --> Stopping : reset / stop
Starting --> Stopping : stop / application shutdown
Stopping --> Idle : terminate VM and remove overlay
Idle --> Starting : reset continues with same mission
state Ready {
 state "Timed: assistance locked" as Locked
 state "Guided / independent: assistance available" as Help
}
note right of Submitted
Timed assistance unlocks after submission.
Recorded results remain in SQLite.
end note
note bottom of Idle
On process startup, orphaned VM state is removed.
Unexpected restart discards the active lab.
end note
